  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Three approaches to the same question: how many distinct values does each attribute have?",
      "options": {
        "mode": "html",
        "content": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0 6px;border:none\"><tr><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #5794f2;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(87,148,242,0.12)\"><b>generator-a/b</b><br><small>sources A and B</small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #5794f2;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(87,148,242,0.12)\"><b>branch-a/b</b><br><small>HLL per attribute key per 1-min window</small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #5794f2;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(87,148,242,0.12)\"><b>merge</b><br><small>both sources&#39; HLLs per window</small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #5794f2;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(87,148,242,0.12)\"><b>detector</b><br><small>distinct counts with bounds; class per key</small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #6e7681;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:none\"><b>Prometheus</b><br><small>query: method=&quot;sketch&quot;</small></div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #ff9830;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(255,152,48,0.10)\"><b>exact-generator-a/b</b><br><small>same points</small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #ff9830;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(255,152,48,0.10)\"><b>exact-branch-a/b</b><br><small>value &rarr; count map per key per 1-min window</small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #ff9830;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(255,152,48,0.10)\"><b>exact-merge</b><br><small>adds both sources&#39; maps: every value</small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #ff9830;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(255,152,48,0.10)\"><b>exact-detector</b><br><small>exact distinct counts and classes</small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #6e7681;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:none\"><b>Prometheus</b><br><small>query: method=&quot;exact&quot;</small></div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #8e8e8e;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(142,142,142,0.12)\"><b>raw-generator-a/b</b><br><small>same points</small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #8e8e8e;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(142,142,142,0.12)\"><b>raw-sink-a/b</b><br><small>the only stage: every point into the log store</small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #8e8e8e;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(142,142,142,0.12)\"><b>loki-raw</b><br><small>stores every raw point</small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #8e8e8e;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(142,142,142,0.12)\"><b>query-job</b><br><small>LogQL distinct count per key once per window</small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #6e7681;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:none\"><b>Prometheus</b><br><small>answer: method=&quot;raw&quot;</small></div></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:4px 0 0 0\"><small>Every stage is one pinned container. Four attributes: <code>http.route</code> and <code>http.method</code> stable, <code>k8s.pod.name</code> growing 5%/min, <code>user.id</code> unique per point. Traffic grows over 30 minutes: the rate per source doubles every 5 minutes (5k to 80k points/s), and at minute 10 <code>http.route</code> explodes from 20 to 20,000 values. query-job compares store and query with exact and times every approach&#39;s backend query.</small></p>"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Answers",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "id": 2
