      "title": "Sketch: latency breakdown per window",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "asap-prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Seconds per segment. branch + to merge: the window's end until the last source's sketch reached the merge. merge: waiting for the other source's sketch (5 s timeout).",
